  "title": "Europe: TotalEnergies to Supply Renewable Electricity to Airbus in Germany and the United Kingdom",
  "summary": "Paris, February 5, 2026 – TotalEnergies and Airbus, a leading aircraft manufacturer, have signed two clean firm power contracts to supply 3.3 TWh to all major Airbus sites located in Germany and the United Kingdom. The electricity supplied to Airbus into the next decade will have a baseload profile and come from new renewable assets […]",
